      },
      {
        "id": "tb-tuple-check-example",
        "moduleId": "tuple-constraint",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "元组约束示例",
        "markdown": "```sql\nCREATE TABLE Student\n(  Sno CHAR(9) PRIMARY KEY,\n   Sname CHAR(20),\n   Ssex CHAR(2),\n   Sage SMALLINT,\n   Sdept CHAR(20),\n   CHECK (Ssex = '女' OR Sname NOT LIKE 'Ms.%')\n);\n```\n\n上述元组约束表示：如果学生是男性，则其名字不能以Ms.开头。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-tuple-constraint"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-check-limitation",
        "moduleId": "tuple-constraint",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "CHECK约束的能力边界",
        "markdown": "CHECK约束只能引用当前表的列，不能引用其他表的列（这是外码约束的职责）。此外，不同数据库管理系统对CHECK表达式的支持程度不同：\n\n- 某些系统限制CHECK中不能使用子查询。\n- 复杂的业务规则可能需要借助触发器或应用程序逻辑来实现。\n\n设计时应优先使用CHECK表达简单、明确的约束，复杂规则再考虑触发器。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-attribute-constraint",
            "tb-tuple-constraint"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "exercise-check-check",
        "moduleId": "check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "CHECK约束检查",
        "markdown": "判断以下CHECK约束定义是否正确，并说明理由：\n\n1. `CHECK (Sage > 0 AND Sage < 150)` —— 定义在Student表的Sage列上。\n2. `CHECK (SC.Sno IN (SELECT Sno FROM Student))` —— 定义在SC表上。\n3. 元组级CHECK约束只能在CREATE TABLE的表级约束中定义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-attribute-constraint",
            "tb-tuple-constraint",
            "model-check-limitation"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
